{"id":"reporting-verbs","lv":"b2","n":17,"cat":"reported","t":"Suggest, advise, deny, admit, refuse: động từ tường thuật","en":"She advised me to… · He denied taking… · suggest + V-ing","sum":"Thay vì chỉ said / told, dùng động từ tường thuật mang sắc thái; mỗi động từ một mẫu riêng. + to V: agree, refuse, offer, promise (The client refused to sign). + người + to V: advise, warn, remind, persuade (My doctor advised me to drink more water); phủ định not to V. + V-ing: deny, admit, suggest, recommend (Tom admitted breaking the printer). + giới từ + V-ing: apologize for, insist on, accuse someone of. Suggest + V-ing hoặc suggest that + người + V — KHÔNG nói suggest someone to do.","forms":[{"f":"agree / refuse / offer / promise + to V","vi":"He refused to sign."},{"f":"advise / warn / remind / persuade + người + to V","vi":"She advised me to rest."},{"f":"deny / admit / suggest / recommend + V-ing","vi":"He denied breaking it."},{"f":"suggest that + người + V (không nói suggest someone to)","vi":"She suggested that we leave early."}],"pts":[{"id":"reporting-verbs","name":"Reporting verbs","vi":"Advise, warn, deny, admit, refuse, offer + mẫu đi kèm"},{"id":"suggest-patterns","name":"suggest / recommend patterns","vi":"Suggest + V-ing / suggest that someone (should) + V"}],"cast":{"ms-khan":{"name":{"en":"Ms Khan","vi":"cô Khan"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"suit","top":"#3B3F4A","topShade":"#2E323B","collar":"#F2F2F2","accent":"#6B4E9B","hair":"bun","hairColor":"#1E1A18","glasses":true,"skin":"#C69272","skinShade":"#B07C5C"},"x":560},"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5A6B8C","topShade":"#4A5A78","accent":"#4A5F8F","hair":"short","hairColor":"#B8863B"},"x":1040}},"bg":"office","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"So what happened at the meeting?","vi":"Vậy cuộc họp diễn ra thế nào?","ipa":["soʊ","wʌt","ˈhæpənd","æt","ðə","ˈmitɪŋ"],"who":"ms-khan","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":1.866,"timi